  "html": "<article id=\"post-6829\" class=\"container post-6829 page type-page status-publish hentry\">\n\n\t<div class=\"entry-content | container\">\n\t\t<section  class=\"container section--services-hero pt-5 services-hero\">\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__left\">\n                <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group full-width-mobile is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-2c90304e wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-7387b849 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img title=\"Wells Fargo Logo - Russell’s American Mechanical\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" src=\"/images/2024/07/Wells-Fargo-Logo.png\" alt=\"Wells Fargo Logo\" class=\"wp-image-6222\" style=\"width:auto;height:55px\" srcset=\"/images/2024/07/Wells-Fargo-Logo.png 500w, /images/2024/07/Wells-Fargo-Logo-300x300.png 300w, /images/2024/07/Wells-Fargo-Logo-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" /></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img title=\"Synchrony Bank logo - Russell’s American Mechanical\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1408\" height=\"300\" src=\"/images/2024/06/Synchrony-Bank-logo.png\" alt=\"Synchrony Bank logo\" class=\"wp-image-5817\" style=\"width:auto;height:55px\" srcset=\"/images/2024/06/Synchrony-Bank-logo.png 1408w, /images/2024/06/Synchrony-Bank-logo-300x64.png 300w, /images/2024/06/Synchrony-Bank-logo-1024x218.png 1024w, /images/2024/06/Synchrony-Bank-logo-768x164.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1408px) 100vw, 1408px\" /></figure>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group h-align is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-7387b849 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">    <div class=\"iconblock wp-elements-1 has-background has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-primary-inverse-color\" data-size=\"md\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"inline\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-money\" /></svg>    </div>\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-x-large-font-size\">Cooling Services Financing</h1>\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">*Subject to credit approval. Ask us for details.</p>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group my-3 is-layout-flex wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">At Russell&#8217;s American Mechanical, we know that upgrading or repairing your cooling system is a big decision. To help make it easier, we’ve partnered with <strong>Wells Fargo</strong> and <strong>Synchrony Bank</strong> to offer flexible financing options. Whether you’re installing a new energy-efficient air conditioner or need a quick repair, our financing plans let you stay comfortable without financial stress. Contact us today to learn more about financing your cooling services.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mb-3 is-content-justification-left is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a1b15d37 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group full-width-mobile is-vertical is-content-justification-stretch is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-41171c72 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<p class=\"horizon-text full-width-mobile has-secondary-font-family wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\">Talk to a Specialist</p>\n\n<a href=\"tel:+17575254911\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"icon\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta full-width-mobile\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span>(757) 525-4911</span>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"text-center has-primary-color has-text-color has-link-color has-secondary-font-family has-small-font-size wp-elements-2 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\"><strong>Same-day appointments available by phone</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\t\t\t</div><!-- ./left -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__right\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-block-post-featured-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1917\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/images/2024/06/A-Russells-American-Mechanical-technician-talking-with-a-customer.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"A Russell’s American Mechanical technician talking with a customer\" srcset=\"/images/2024/06/A-Russells-American-Mechanical-technician-talking-with-a-customer.jpg 1917w, /images/2024/06/A-Russells-American-Mechanical-technician-talking-with-a-customer-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/06/A-Russells-American-Mechanical-technician-talking-with-a-customer-1024x684.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/06/A-Russells-American-Mechanical-technician-talking-with-a-customer-768x513.jpg 768w, /images/2024/06/A-Russells-American-Mechanical-technician-talking-with-a-customer-1536x1026.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1917px) 100vw, 1917px\" title=\"A Russell’s American Mechanical technician talking with a customer - Russell’s American Mechanical\" /></figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\t\t\t</div><!-- ./right -->\n\t\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</div>\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main section--services-hero__main--empty has-background has-secondary-background-color\">\n\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container pb-5 flow has-primary-inverse-color has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-3\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cooling Services in Norfolk, VA</h2>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Cooling system repairs and installations can vary in cost depending on the type of service needed. From quick fixes to full system replacements, cooling services in Norfolk, VA, typically range from <strong>$300 to $10,000</strong>. Contact Russell’s American Mechanical today for a personalized estimate.</p>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Financing with Wells Fargo and Synchrony Bank</h2>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We’ve partnered with Wells Fargo and Synchrony Bank to provide flexible financing options for your cooling system needs:</p>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Low Monthly Payments:</strong> Spread out the cost of your cooling system over time.</li>\n\n<li><strong>Promotional Offers:</strong> Take advantage of special financing terms during promotional periods.</li>\n\n<li><strong>Quick Approvals:</strong> Get fast approval so you can stay cool without delay.</li>\n\n<li><a href=\"https://retailservices.wellsfargo.com/ahapp/init-app?m=0024334237&amp;l=en_US\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Apply with Wells Fargo</a></li>\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.mysynchrony.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Apply with Synchrony Bank</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why Choose Russell&#8217;s American Mechanical?</h2>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Russell&#8217;s American Mechanical has been proudly serving Norfolk and the surrounding areas for years. With expert technicians, reliable cooling services, and flexible financing, we’re committed to keeping your home comfortable. Let us help you find the best cooling solution to fit your needs and budget.</p>\n\n<a href=\"/contact-us\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta align-self-center\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span >Contact Us Today</span>\n        <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>\n</a></div>\n\t</div>\n\t</article><!-- #post-6829 -->"
